menuconfig MODULES_SELF_RIGHT
	bool "self_right"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the autonomous self-righting controller. Recovers a tilt-wing aircraft from an
		inverted, at-rest float to upright using propeller thrust only: rotates the wing so the
		props point up, drives the airframe past its over-center tipping point, then cuts throttle
		and hands back to MANUAL. Exposes the SELF_RIGHT flight mode (gated on inverted + at rest).
